62
00:05:49,888 --> 00:05:50,068
[SPEAKER_03]: Why?

63
00:05:50,089 --> 00:05:52,631
[SPEAKER_03]: Because the stream hasn't been polluted in its origin.

64
00:05:53,432 --> 00:05:56,915
